{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/pulls/190942","id":4255973430,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAeUeuM79rQA2","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/190942","diff_url":"https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/190942.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/190942.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/190942","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/pulls/190942/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/pulls/190942/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/190942/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/statuses/1b89f3845fc2ce3cb85f0f360750acc6066dbf4b","number":190942,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Reland \"[web] Keep the keyboard up during an iOS caret drag\"","user":{"login":"flutter-zl","id":205370234,"node_id":"U_kgDODD2zeg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205370234?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter-zl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/flutter/flutter/issues/189744\r\n\r\n**Reland of #190014, reverted in #190926.**\r\n\r\nCause: three of the new tests dispatch a real input.blur(), but desktop Safari uses SafariDesktopTextEditingStrategy, which does not subscribe to blur, so handleBlur never ran. Real iOS does subscribe, so the fix itself was unaffected.\r\n\r\nDelta: one test-only commit adding skip: isSafari to those three tests. No production change.\r\n\r\n**Problem**\r\nOn iOS 27, long-press-dragging the selection caret in a Web TextField dismisses the keyboard mid-gesture. WebKit transiently blurs the hidden input with a null relatedTarget while the document keeps focus, then refocuses it a frame later,and the engine reacted to that blink on two listeners that each tore the input down. A plain input ignores the same blur, so the cause is Flutter's reaction, not a WebKit limitation.\r\n\r\n**Fix**\r\nOn iOS both listeners now defer their teardown by 100ms and cancel it if the input refocuses, mirroring the existing https://github.com/flutter/flutter/issues/155265 deferred close. Done and tap-away never refocus so they still close, and the deferral is narrowed to the exact drag signature so every other focus transition is unaffected.\r\n\r\n**Demo**\r\nBefore: https://flutter-demo-52-before.web.app/ (keyboard dismisses mid caret drag)\r\nAfter: https://flutter-demo-52-after.web.app/ (keyboard stays up)\r\n\r\nRepro on iOS 27 Safari: tap the field to raise the keyboard, then long-press and drag the selection caret. Before dismisses; after stays up. Done and tap-away still dismiss.","labels":[{"id":283479178,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM0NzkxNzg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/labels/a:%20text%20input","name":"a: text input","description":"Entering text in a text field or keyboard related problems","color":"55ddbb","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":284438921,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODQ0Mzg5MjE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/labels/engine","name":"engine","description":"flutter/engine related. See also e: labels.","color":"FC6401","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1158512952,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTU4NTEyOTUy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/labels/platform-web","name":"platform-web","description":"Web applications specifically","color":"c0408a","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1746225487,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzQ2MjI1NDg3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/labels/f:%20focus","name":"f: focus","description":"Focus traversal, gaining or losing focus","color":"207de5","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5706368717,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAeUeuM8AAAABVCBGzQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/labels/team-web","name":"team-web","description":"Owned by Web platform team","color":"198022","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10404216443,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAeUeuM8AAAACbCO-ew","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/labels/CICD","name":"CICD","description":"Run CI/CD","color":"0052cc","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-11T18:41:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T00:02:59Z","closed_at":"2026-09-18T00:02:56Z","merged_at":"2026-09-18T00:02:56Z","merge_commit_sha":"634b0ed597124ca57830047cad4358371fd4e517","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"flutter-zl:reland_189744","ref":"reland_189744","repo":{"id":959012027,"node_id":"R_kgDOOSlcuw","name":"flutter","full_name":"flutter-zl/flutter","owner":{"login":"flutter-zl","id":205370234,"node_id":"U_kgDODD2zeg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205370234?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter-zl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-z